# Baron Helmut Zemo: "up to three of the copies". Bot1 exiles four cards - the Excruciator, Pox Plague, Griselbrand and an Entomb
# (16 symbols; more than fifteen is allowed) - and casts the Entomb copy (an instant, it searches for a Swamp), the Griselbrand copy
# and the Excruciator copy. The fourth, Pox Plague, is not offered: the boast is over after three casts, the Pox Plague copy
# ceases to exist and the card stays in exile, so Bot2 loses no life to it. The Entomb copy is cast from exile, not from Bot1's
# hand, so Zemo does not connive for it: its single +1/+1 counter is the one from the earlier Entomb cast from the hand.

